  ==>   ping will NOT answer, and that is not a failure.
        This loader implements TFTP and no ICMP at all, measured 2026-08-17.
        What does show the link is live, none of it needing an upload:
          * arp -n 10.1.1.1  resolves
          * the host interface's rx_packets counter moves
          * a TFTP read request comes back with DATA
        Entering rescue mode is the whole of what P9-3 asks. Nothing is uploaded.
